WEBVTT

00:27.747 --> 00:29.747
<b>[SUBARU] Is there
really not a single person,</b>

00:29.787 --> 00:32.287
<b>even if anyone is--</b>

00:32.327 --> 00:34.747
<b>just the slightest
memory of him.</b>

00:34.787 --> 00:36.457
<b>Enough, Subaru.</b>

00:36.497 --> 00:37.757
<b>It's fine.</b>

00:40.797 --> 00:43.597
<b>He should know
that this is Julius.</b>

00:43.637 --> 00:46.057
<b>Julius Juukulius in full.</b>

00:46.097 --> 00:48.017
<b>I think you've all
figured this out,</b>

00:48.057 --> 00:49.477
<b>but he's one
of Gluttony's victims</b>

00:49.517 --> 00:51.057
<b>that's been left nameless.</b>

00:51.097 --> 00:54.607
<b>That said, his mind
is still intact.</b>

00:54.647 --> 00:56.897
<b>He's not like Gluttony's
other victims.</b>

00:56.937 --> 00:59.397
<b>They all either had their
memories consumed and ended up</b>

00:59.437 --> 01:02.027
<b>like Lady Crusch,
or had both their names</b>

01:02.067 --> 01:04.487
<b>and their memories consumed
and ended up in a state</b>

01:04.527 --> 01:09.367
<b>like Rem's But with Julius,
only his name was consumed.</b>

01:09.407 --> 01:11.917
<b>So you mean
he's an exception?</b>

01:11.957 --> 01:14.667
<b>Everybody else
has forgotten, but</b>

01:14.707 --> 01:16.707
<b>he still remembers who he is?</b>

01:16.747 --> 01:19.507
<b>Your uniform tells me
that you must be a knight.</b>

01:19.547 --> 01:21.257
<b>I'm sure you must have
been an acquaintance</b>

01:21.297 --> 01:23.467
<b>of myself and Felix.</b>

01:23.507 --> 01:26.927
<b>Perhaps even we were
closer than that.</b>

01:26.967 --> 01:28.347
<b>At the very least.</b>

01:28.387 --> 01:29.637
<b>I thought of both of you</b>

01:29.677 --> 01:31.387
<b>as important friends of mine.</b>

01:31.427 --> 01:32.477
<b>Damn it.</b>

01:32.517 --> 01:33.937
<b>[ANASTASIA] You think you</b>

01:33.977 --> 01:35.557
<b>were just everyday friends?</b>

01:35.607 --> 01:39.067
<b>If you ask me, I think there's
a lot more to it than that.</b>

01:39.107 --> 01:41.357
<b>Lady Anastasia.</b>

01:41.397 --> 01:43.907
<b>[sighs]</b>

01:43.947 --> 01:46.907
<b>I've got a suggestion I'd
like to share with all of you.</b>

01:46.947 --> 01:48.197
<b>May I?</b>

01:50.037 --> 01:52.497
<b>In these city walls,
there are many people</b>

01:52.537 --> 01:54.617
<b>who were either
transformed by Lust,</b>

01:54.667 --> 01:57.747
<b>or who were left without their
names, thanks to Gluttony.</b>

01:57.787 --> 02:00.457
<b>We may have captured
the Sin Archbishops and all,</b>

02:00.507 --> 02:01.877
<b>but I doubt they're
going to just come</b>

02:01.917 --> 02:03.507
<b>out and give us
the secret to fixing</b>

02:03.547 --> 02:05.677
<b>everything just like that.</b>

02:05.717 --> 02:07.097
<b>We're in a bit of a pickle.</b>

02:07.137 --> 02:08.887
<b>You thought now was
the appropriate time</b>

02:08.927 --> 02:09.927
<b>to bring that up?</b>

02:09.967 --> 02:11.217
<b>And that means we've just</b>

02:11.267 --> 02:12.727
<b>got to ask someone else who</b>

02:12.767 --> 02:14.557
<b>has the knowledge to tell us.</b>

02:14.597 --> 02:19.437
<b>Someone we can tell
everything, who's really smart?</b>

02:19.477 --> 02:20.607
<b>That's right.</b>

02:20.647 --> 02:22.317
<b>And you see, there's someone</b>

02:22.357 --> 02:23.897
<b>who's "really smart" here</b>

02:23.947 --> 02:25.317
<b>in this city, ain't there?</b>

02:25.357 --> 02:27.617
<b>Quit being vague
and just spit it out then.</b>

02:27.657 --> 02:28.907
<b>You mean?</b>

02:29.947 --> 02:31.867
<b>Shaula the sage.</b>

02:31.907 --> 02:33.407
<b>Shaula?</b>

02:33.447 --> 02:34.997
<b>Yep.</b>

02:35.037 --> 02:37.667
<b>Of the Three Great
Heroes of Lugunica.</b>

02:41.297 --> 02:43.127
<b>[NARRATOR] Shaula the sage.</b>

02:47.177 --> 02:49.217
<b>[SUBARU] Long ago,
in the Dragon Friend Kingdom</b>

02:49.257 --> 02:52.637
<b>of Lugunica, there was
an accomplished band of heroes.</b>

02:52.677 --> 02:55.887
<b>They were the Master Swordsman,
the Dragon Lord and the Sage,</b>

02:55.937 --> 03:00.357
<b>together known
as the Three Great Heroes.</b>

03:00.397 --> 03:01.397
<b>That right?</b>

03:01.437 --> 03:02.477
<b>Yep.</b>

03:02.527 --> 03:03.937
<b>The keeper of knowledge who</b>

03:03.987 --> 03:05.607
<b>foresees all that will ever be,</b>

03:05.647 --> 03:08.277
<b>standing at the far
eastern edge of Lugunica,</b>

03:08.317 --> 03:10.617
<b>in the Auguria
dunes, we'll find</b>

03:10.657 --> 03:13.157
<b>the Pleiades Watchtower,
which was built to guard</b>

03:13.197 --> 03:15.407
<b>the sealed Witch of Envy.</b>

03:15.447 --> 03:18.497
<b>The legendary sage lives
there in total seclusion.</b>

03:18.537 --> 03:20.877
<b>And if my hunch is right,
she might just have</b>

03:20.917 --> 03:23.167
<b>the answers we're looking for.</b>

03:23.207 --> 03:25.667
<b>[OTTO] To be frank,
I'm still against going</b>

03:25.717 --> 03:27.377
<b>through with this plan.</b>

03:27.417 --> 03:29.757
<b>I mean, aren't we
talking about a place</b>

03:29.797 --> 03:32.427
<b>even you weren't
able to reach before?</b>

03:32.467 --> 03:36.187
<b>Two years back, when illness
befell the royal family,</b>

03:36.227 --> 03:38.517
<b>the council sent me
out on special orders,</b>

03:38.557 --> 03:40.347
<b>hoping I could find a cure.</b>

03:40.397 --> 03:43.317
<b>My goal was
the Pleiades Watchtower.</b>

03:43.357 --> 03:48.737
<b>But I never made it there,
no matter how far I traveled.</b>

03:48.777 --> 03:51.367
<b>The tower in the distance
never drew closer.</b>

03:51.407 --> 03:53.367
<b>It must have been
some sort of barrier,</b>

03:53.407 --> 03:57.367
<b>and I found myself
unable to cross it.</b>

03:57.407 --> 03:59.957
<b>The Auguria dunes
are famous for being</b>

03:59.997 --> 04:02.957
<b>a giant den of mabests,
if I recall correctly.</b>

04:02.997 --> 04:05.167
<b>Should Mr. Natsuki
and the others really</b>

04:05.207 --> 04:08.127
<b>be going to a dangerous
place like that on their own?</b>

04:08.167 --> 04:09.927
<b>[REINHARD] We must have faith.</b>

04:09.967 --> 04:12.847
<b>I have a duty to fulfill,
escorting Lady Felt</b>

04:12.887 --> 04:14.677
<b>and that Sin Archbishop.</b>

04:16.767 --> 04:20.687
<b>Besides, it's
painfully obvious,</b>

04:20.727 --> 04:23.107
<b>this city's people
still need us.</b>

04:30.567 --> 04:34.027
<b>[chuckles]</b>

04:36.247 --> 04:39.497
<b>[fire crackling]</b>

04:41.247 --> 04:43.207
<b>[SUBARU] A place that
even Reinhardt has tried</b>

04:43.247 --> 04:45.957
<b>and failed to get into, huh?</b>

04:45.997 --> 04:48.007
<b>Just hearing that part
alone makes all this</b>

04:48.047 --> 04:50.257
<b>seem pretty dang hopeless.</b>

04:50.297 --> 04:51.677
<b>[BEATRICE]
Subaru, you're getting</b>

04:51.717 --> 04:54.007
<b>a scary look on your face.</b>

04:54.047 --> 04:57.267
<b>If your worries cause you to
neglect our physical contact,</b>

04:57.307 --> 04:59.937
<b>then you see, old Betty's
cuteness will go to waste,</b>

04:59.977 --> 05:01.017
<b>I suppose.</b>

05:01.057 --> 05:02.227
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

05:02.267 --> 05:04.147
<b>Wait, you're right.</b>

05:04.187 --> 05:05.977
<b>I only zoned out
for a minute there,</b>

05:06.017 --> 05:08.067
<b>and now you're such an uggo.</b>

05:08.107 --> 05:09.317
<b>That is a dirty lie.</b>

05:09.357 --> 05:10.317
<b>[laughing]</b>

05:10.357 --> 05:11.317
<b>[EMILIA] Beatrice.</b>

05:11.357 --> 05:12.697
<b>Huh?</b>

05:12.737 --> 05:15.317
<b>Isn't it just
about your bedtime?</b>

05:15.367 --> 05:17.287
<b>Would you like
to come sleep with me?</b>

05:17.327 --> 05:19.617
<b>[yawns]</b>

05:19.657 --> 05:21.577
<b>I will, I suppose.</b>

05:21.617 --> 05:24.667
<b>Staying up all night is bad
for your health, after all.</b>

05:25.917 --> 05:30.127
<b>[owl hooting]</b>

05:38.387 --> 05:41.057
<b>[ANASTASIA] Natsuki,
you're still up?</b>

05:41.097 --> 05:42.557
<b>Yeah.</b>

05:42.597 --> 05:44.347
<b>Even on a safe road,
it's best for someone</b>

05:44.387 --> 05:45.607
<b>to keep watch, right?</b>

05:45.647 --> 05:46.897
<b>Right, we just don't have</b>

05:46.937 --> 05:48.317
<b>enough people, do we?</b>

05:48.357 --> 05:50.147
<b>I sure wish Ricardo
would have been</b>

05:50.187 --> 05:52.197
<b>able to come with
us on this journey.</b>

05:52.237 --> 05:54.237
<b>But with his arm like that.</b>

05:55.447 --> 05:57.617
<b>[SUBARU] How about you
tell me the truth already?</b>

05:57.657 --> 05:58.657
<b>Huh?</b>

05:58.697 --> 06:00.157
<b>Where's this coming from?</b>

06:00.197 --> 06:01.407
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

06:01.447 --> 06:02.957
<b>You're a seriously
lousy actor.</b>

06:02.997 --> 06:04.457
<b>Just drop it.</b>

06:04.497 --> 06:06.497
<b>[sighs]</b>

06:07.417 --> 06:09.707
<b>I know you're not
Lady Anastasia.</b>

06:09.747 --> 06:13.217
<b>That face and voice aren't your
playthings, so knock it off.</b>

06:14.967 --> 06:17.347
<b>How interesting.</b>

06:17.387 --> 06:20.557
<b>How did you figure out that
I wasn't the actual Ana?</b>

06:20.597 --> 06:22.517
<b>Something has seemed off
with you this whole time,</b>

06:22.557 --> 06:24.187
<b>but now I know for certain.</b>

06:24.227 --> 06:26.727
<b>It's true that lady
Anastasia is a realist,</b>

06:26.767 --> 06:28.767
<b>but there's no way she'd
ever talk so coldly</b>

06:28.817 --> 06:30.727
<b>about a close friend
dealing with such</b>

06:30.767 --> 06:32.687
<b>a life changing injury.</b>

06:32.737 --> 06:34.237
<b>[sighs]</b>

06:34.277 --> 06:36.697
<b>I keep getting outed
like this left and right.</b>

06:36.737 --> 06:37.987
<b>It's kind of embarrassing.</b>

06:38.027 --> 06:39.117
<b>Wait, hold on.</b>

06:39.157 --> 06:40.737
<b>You mean I'm not the only one?</b>

06:40.777 --> 06:44.617
<b>Priscilla Barrielle,
the one who called me a vixen?</b>

06:44.657 --> 06:46.577
<b>She sure is a scary woman.</b>

06:46.617 --> 06:48.377
<b>Who exactly are you, then?</b>

06:48.417 --> 06:49.747
<b>And what are you trying to do?</b>

06:49.787 --> 06:50.997
<b>Echidna.</b>

06:54.377 --> 06:55.837
<b>What?</b>

06:55.877 --> 06:58.177
<b>My name is Echidna.</b>

06:58.217 --> 07:02.467
<b>And what I am is
an artificial spirit.</b>

07:02.507 --> 07:05.057
<b>Frankly, it's not all that
surprising that you'd assume I</b>

07:05.097 --> 07:07.557
<b>took possession of Ana's body.</b>

07:07.597 --> 07:10.607
<b>That's why I was hesitant
to tell you the truth.</b>

07:12.937 --> 07:15.817
<b>What kind of terrible
joke is this?</b>

07:15.857 --> 07:18.817
<b>So you're Echidna?</b>

07:18.867 --> 07:20.617
<b>Is Lady Anastasia--</b>

07:20.657 --> 07:21.827
<b>[gasps]</b>

07:21.867 --> 07:22.907
<b>You don't mean, all the</b>

07:22.947 --> 07:24.247
<b>terrible things that happened</b>

07:24.287 --> 07:26.407
<b>in Priestella were your doing?</b>

07:26.447 --> 07:28.417
<b>Would you just
calm down a sec?</b>

07:28.457 --> 07:30.787
<b>I think there's a huge
misunderstanding here.</b>

07:30.827 --> 07:33.917
<b>You expect me to calm down
after all that, you vile witch?</b>

07:33.957 --> 07:36.217
<b>What the hell have you
done with Lady Anastasia?</b>

07:36.257 --> 07:37.927
<b>Please, I wish
you'd stop treating</b>

07:37.967 --> 07:39.637
<b>me like some evil mastermind.</b>

07:39.677 --> 07:42.717
<b>I promise, I have no
intention of harming her.</b>

07:42.757 --> 07:45.717
<b>Besides, I've been together
with her for over 10 years.</b>

07:45.767 --> 07:47.137
<b>What the hell are you--</b>

07:47.187 --> 07:48.767
<b>wait, over 10 years?</b>

07:48.807 --> 07:50.267
<b>Mm-hmm.</b>

07:50.307 --> 07:53.477
<b>First of all, let me clear
up the misunderstanding.</b>

07:53.517 --> 07:54.937
<b>The Echidna that
you're thinking of</b>

07:54.987 --> 07:57.527
<b>is someone completely
different from me.</b>

07:57.567 --> 07:59.277
<b>The thing is,
other than the fact</b>

07:59.317 --> 08:02.197
<b>that I was created
as an artificial spirit,</b>

08:02.237 --> 08:05.747
<b>and the fact that my name is
Echidna, I know next to nothing</b>

08:05.787 --> 08:07.197
<b>about myself.</b>

08:07.247 --> 08:10.787
<b>You're an artificial
spirit, same as Beako?</b>

08:10.827 --> 08:13.087
<b>Strictly speaking,
this fox muffler</b>

08:13.127 --> 08:17.757
<b>Ana's always wearing around her
neck is actually my real body.</b>

08:17.797 --> 08:22.047
<b>So you see, I've been watching
all of you for a long time.</b>

08:22.087 --> 08:24.467
<b>Why would you choose
now for this reveal?</b>

08:24.507 --> 08:27.177
<b>Is it because you're finally
prepared to take full control</b>

08:27.217 --> 08:29.937
<b>over her body, Foxidna?</b>

08:29.977 --> 08:31.477
<b>Foxidna?</b>

08:31.517 --> 08:35.437
<b>I can't say that I'm
particularly fond of that name.</b>

08:35.477 --> 08:38.777
<b>I had no intention
of taking over Ana's body.</b>

08:38.817 --> 08:41.987
<b>This unfortunate outcome
isn't what I had hoped for.</b>

08:42.027 --> 08:44.327
<b>If that's the truth
and it's not what you wanted,</b>

08:44.367 --> 08:46.867
<b>why not go back
into that fox muffler?</b>

08:46.907 --> 08:49.617
<b>Believe me, I would
love to do just that.</b>

08:50.747 --> 08:53.627
<b>But that's no longer an option.</b>

08:53.667 --> 08:54.917
<b>And why is that?</b>

08:54.957 --> 08:57.127
<b>What's wrong with
Lady Anastasia's body</b>

08:57.167 --> 08:58.917
<b>that you can't leave?</b>

08:58.967 --> 09:01.007
<b>I'm going to be blunt.</b>

09:01.047 --> 09:04.387
<b>I'm using Ana's Od as a medium
to overwrite her mind</b>

09:04.427 --> 09:06.507
<b>with my own consciousness.</b>

09:06.547 --> 09:09.927
<b>Her consciousness is sleeping
in the depths of her Od,</b>

09:09.977 --> 09:13.017
<b>giving me complete
control over her body.</b>

09:13.057 --> 09:15.857
<b>I can even cast magic
by using her gate,</b>

09:15.897 --> 09:17.607
<b>even though it's
rather defective.</b>

09:17.647 --> 09:19.817
<b>Wait, something's
wrong with her gate?</b>

09:19.857 --> 09:22.027
<b>Then if you're using
magic that consistently,</b>

09:22.067 --> 09:24.367
<b>wouldn't it put way too
much strain on her body?</b>

09:24.407 --> 09:26.737
<b>The only reason I'd
ever risk her life</b>

09:26.777 --> 09:29.997
<b>is because it was already
in danger to begin with.</b>

09:30.037 --> 09:32.327
<b>I have, of course, talked
with Ana about this</b>

09:32.367 --> 09:33.877
<b>and earned her consent.</b>

09:33.917 --> 09:35.577
<b>So this isn't the first time?</b>

09:35.627 --> 09:37.547
<b>You've borrowed
her body before?</b>

09:37.587 --> 09:40.917
<b>There were a few other
occasions, but none</b>

09:40.967 --> 09:43.507
<b>where I was unable to return.</b>

09:43.547 --> 09:47.007
<b>So I'm at a loss as to what
to do right now myself.</b>

09:47.047 --> 09:50.727
<b>[fire crackling]</b>

09:51.977 --> 09:55.977
<b>The thing is, I love Ana.</b>

09:56.017 --> 09:57.687
<b>I don't know if I'm
right about this</b>

09:57.727 --> 09:59.687
<b>since I've never
had one myself,</b>

09:59.727 --> 10:02.397
<b>but I feel as if she's
something very close to what</b>

10:02.447 --> 10:04.647
<b>people call family.</b>

10:04.697 --> 10:08.367
<b>All I want is for her to be
as healthy, and above all,</b>

10:08.407 --> 10:10.367
<b>as happy as possible.</b>

10:12.537 --> 10:14.707
<b>So your real reason
for wanting to go</b>

10:14.747 --> 10:16.747
<b>see the sage is actually--</b>

10:16.787 --> 10:17.747
<b>Mm.</b>

10:17.787 --> 10:19.127
<b>My one goal is to</b>

10:19.167 --> 10:21.007
<b>figure out a way I can</b>

10:21.047 --> 10:23.087
<b>give Ana's body back to her.</b>

10:23.127 --> 10:26.597
<b>To do that, I won't hesitate
to use you and your companions.</b>

10:26.637 --> 10:29.007
<b>I understand what you want
and all, but are you sure</b>

10:29.047 --> 10:32.477
<b>the sage knows how to get
you back to normal?</b>

10:32.517 --> 10:33.887
<b>No, I'm not.</b>

10:33.927 --> 10:36.437
<b>However, if the sage
is powerful,</b>

10:36.477 --> 10:38.477
<b>if she really sees
all and knows all,</b>

10:38.517 --> 10:41.437
<b>like the stories say,
there's a chance.</b>

10:41.487 --> 10:44.237
<b>I will make the choice that
offers the highest probability</b>

10:44.277 --> 10:46.647
<b>of success, period.</b>

10:46.697 --> 10:48.197
<b>[sighs]</b>

10:49.277 --> 10:52.287
<b>That's kind of a lot
you just sprung on me.</b>

10:52.327 --> 10:54.787
<b>But I at least understand.</b>

10:54.827 --> 10:57.077
<b>You have a clear goal,
as well as a solid plan</b>

10:57.127 --> 10:58.747
<b>of action to accomplish it.</b>

10:58.787 --> 11:00.747
<b>It's not something that'll
get in the way of what</b>

11:00.787 --> 11:02.587
<b>we're trying to do either.</b>

11:02.627 --> 11:03.587
<b>Indeed.</b>

11:03.627 --> 11:04.667
<b>At the end of the day,</b>

11:04.717 --> 11:05.797
<b>we're both going because</b>

11:05.837 --> 11:07.427
<b>we have questions for the sage.</b>

11:07.467 --> 11:08.597
<b>Right then.</b>

11:08.637 --> 11:10.137
<b>All I ask is not to mention</b>

11:10.177 --> 11:11.927
<b>borrowing Lady Anastasia's body</b>

11:11.967 --> 11:13.097
<b>to Julius, OK?</b>

11:13.137 --> 11:16.437
<b>In fact, don't
tell anyone at all.</b>

11:16.477 --> 11:18.397
<b>I don't have
a problem with that.</b>

11:18.437 --> 11:20.857
<b>But I'm surprised you
wouldn't want to tell them.</b>

11:20.897 --> 11:22.937
<b>Only because the timing
sucks as it is,</b>

11:22.977 --> 11:25.277
<b>and I really don't want
to make any unnecessary waves</b>

11:25.317 --> 11:26.277
<b>right now.</b>

11:26.317 --> 11:28.197
<b>Makes sense.</b>

11:28.237 --> 11:30.117
<b>After all, you have
something else you want</b>

11:30.157 --> 11:31.907
<b>to ask the sage to help with.</b>

11:31.947 --> 11:33.947
<b>Something more personal, right?</b>

11:33.997 --> 11:35.367
<b>[SUBARU] Well, that's--</b>

11:38.957 --> 11:42.087
<b>So then, we'll make a stop
at Margrave Mather's mansion</b>

11:42.127 --> 11:43.297
<b>on the way.</b>

11:43.337 --> 11:44.667
<b>I'm sure you want
to prepare yourself</b>

11:44.707 --> 11:46.757
<b>to cross the dunes
soon, but the mansion</b>

11:46.797 --> 11:49.637
<b>is where that sleeping
beauty of yours is.</b>

11:49.677 --> 11:52.927
<b>You do intend to take
her with you, correct?</b>

11:54.887 --> 11:58.137
<b>If you ask me, that's not
such a bad idea, you know.</b>

11:58.187 --> 12:00.807
<b>We'll still save all of them.</b>

12:00.857 --> 12:02.437
<b>It just comes down
to who's going to be</b>

12:02.477 --> 12:04.437
<b>the first one in line, really.</b>

12:04.477 --> 12:05.897
<b>I don't think
anyone would blame</b>

12:05.937 --> 12:09.857
<b>you if you used your position
to make that her.</b>

12:13.117 --> 12:14.367
<b>[SUBARU] Rem.</b>

12:15.657 --> 12:18.617
<b>[MARGRAVE] Your letter
informed me of the situation.</b>

12:18.657 --> 12:20.877
<b>You managed minimal
casualties in the battle</b>

12:20.917 --> 12:22.377
<b>against Sin Archbishops.</b>

12:22.417 --> 12:23.957
<b>It brings me
great relief to know</b>

12:23.997 --> 12:25.797
<b>that Garf was of use as well.</b>

12:25.837 --> 12:28.877
<b>Also, I am grateful Master
Otto seems to be all right.</b>

12:28.917 --> 12:31.927
<b>Mr. Otto is always way
too reckless, though.</b>

12:31.967 --> 12:35.507
<b>And after we were able to send
out such fantastic news, too.</b>

12:35.557 --> 12:37.517
<b>Oh right, the meeting
with the fakes.</b>

12:37.557 --> 12:39.727
<b>I heard it was
something to celebrate.</b>

12:39.767 --> 12:42.727
<b>You'll have to fill us in on
all the details later, then.</b>

12:42.767 --> 12:43.727
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:43.767 --> 12:45.817
<b>I mean, yes.</b>

12:45.857 --> 12:46.817
<b>Oh.</b>

12:46.857 --> 12:47.937
<b>Natsuki, what a very</b>

12:47.987 --> 12:49.067
<b>sinful man you are.</b>

12:49.107 --> 12:50.277
<b>Right.</b>

12:50.317 --> 12:51.487
<b>Now, after that,
it's clear to see</b>

12:51.527 --> 12:52.567
<b>why people have
been calling you</b>

12:52.617 --> 12:54.077
<b>the little girl user, Subaru.</b>

12:54.117 --> 12:55.777
<b>Just so you know, it's
not really fair to call</b>

12:55.827 --> 12:57.327
<b>Petra a little girl now.</b>

12:57.367 --> 12:58.997
<b>And if I do use
any little girls,</b>

12:59.037 --> 13:01.207
<b>it would only be Beako, OK?</b>

13:01.247 --> 13:02.327
<b>Mhm!</b>

13:02.377 --> 13:03.957
<b>The outcome we
had in Priestella</b>

13:03.997 --> 13:06.127
<b>wasn't just thanks
to Garfiel and Otto.</b>

13:06.167 --> 13:10.087
<b>Everyone in the city worked
hard together to achieve it.</b>

13:10.127 --> 13:11.377
<b>But still.</b>

13:11.427 --> 13:13.337
<b>You're heading
for the sage's tower</b>

13:13.387 --> 13:15.547
<b>in order to discover
a way to save the victims</b>

13:15.597 --> 13:17.097
<b>of Gluttony and Lust, right?</b>

13:17.137 --> 13:19.677
<b>A dangerous path indeed.</b>

13:19.727 --> 13:21.727
<b>Is there even
a chance of success?</b>

13:21.767 --> 13:24.477
<b>Margrave Mathers, I
understand your concern.</b>

13:24.517 --> 13:27.517
<b>I know this is of great
importance to you.</b>

13:27.567 --> 13:30.937
<b>However, there are still many
people suffering in Priestella.</b>

13:30.987 --> 13:33.317
<b>Their bodies and minds left
damaged thanks to the witch</b>

13:33.357 --> 13:35.197
<b>cult's nefarious deeds.</b>

13:35.237 --> 13:38.027
<b>Oh my, you put that
so very elegantly.</b>

13:38.077 --> 13:39.997
<b>And since I have
not recognized you,</b>

13:40.037 --> 13:45.077
<b>I assume you are one
of them yourself, correct?</b>

13:45.127 --> 13:47.287
<b>We're talking about
where things stand here.</b>

13:47.337 --> 13:51.717
<b>We made a stop at the mansion
for Rem and one more.</b>

13:51.757 --> 13:53.507
<b>The small girl
who is currently</b>

13:53.547 --> 13:56.177
<b>in the mansion's prison, yes?</b>

13:59.257 --> 14:01.427
<b>[locks clicking]</b>

14:02.597 --> 14:06.897
<b>My, My, I sure didn't
expect to see you here.</b>

14:06.937 --> 14:07.937
<b>Yeah.</b>

14:07.977 --> 14:09.477
<b>I have important business</b>

14:09.527 --> 14:11.687
<b>to talk about with you, Meili.</b>

14:12.777 --> 14:14.357
<b>[MEILI] The Auguria dunes, huh?</b>

14:14.397 --> 14:17.777
<b>I've been there before
to get myself more mabeasts.</b>

14:17.827 --> 14:20.537
<b>You should know that place
is really teeming with them.</b>

14:20.577 --> 14:21.617
<b>That's it.</b>

14:21.657 --> 14:23.037
<b>That's what I want to know.</b>

14:23.077 --> 14:24.907
<b>I want to learn from
the experiences of someone</b>

14:24.957 --> 14:26.747
<b>who's actually been out there.</b>

14:26.787 --> 14:29.127
<b>I mean, there's a huge
difference between info</b>

14:29.167 --> 14:31.337
<b>that comes from someone's
firsthand knowledge and</b>

14:31.377 --> 14:33.217
<b>info that doesn't, you know?</b>

14:33.257 --> 14:34.917
<b>And it's very
reassuring for someone</b>

14:34.967 --> 14:36.887
<b>without any of that at all.</b>

14:36.927 --> 14:38.547
<b>[sighs]</b>

14:38.597 --> 14:41.557
<b>If there's something you want
me to do, just spit it out.</b>

14:42.767 --> 14:44.347
<b>OK.</b>

14:44.387 --> 14:47.017
<b>If we have a mabeast
user like you with us,</b>

14:47.057 --> 14:49.727
<b>we might make it through
the dunes in one piece.</b>

14:49.767 --> 14:51.527
<b>So, would you come
with us, and--</b>

14:51.567 --> 14:52.527
<b>All right.</b>

14:52.567 --> 14:53.567
<b>Yeah, I realize you</b>

14:53.607 --> 14:54.897
<b>don't want to go outside,</b>

14:54.937 --> 14:57.447
<b>and I'm asking a lot, but if</b>

14:57.487 --> 14:59.867
<b>you could maybe just-- uh?</b>

14:59.907 --> 15:01.447
<b>Do I have to repeat myself?</b>

15:01.487 --> 15:04.157
<b>I said I'm willing
to go along with you.</b>

15:04.207 --> 15:05.207
<b>What?</b>

15:05.247 --> 15:06.157
<b>Really?</b>

15:06.207 --> 15:07.377
<b>Sure thing.</b>

15:07.417 --> 15:08.707
<b>I'll take care
of the mabeast problem</b>

15:08.747 --> 15:10.497
<b>in whatever way you want me to.</b>

15:10.537 --> 15:12.587
<b>I can keep them away
from us, tame them,</b>

15:12.627 --> 15:14.257
<b>make them kill each
other, or even make</b>

15:14.297 --> 15:15.667
<b>them eat the sage if you want.</b>

15:15.717 --> 15:16.887
<b>It's your choice.</b>

15:16.917 --> 15:18.427
<b>At the very least, please</b>

15:18.467 --> 15:19.927
<b>don't do those last two.</b>

15:19.967 --> 15:21.637
<b>But I'm confused.</b>

15:21.677 --> 15:23.057
<b>I thought that
you were refusing</b>

15:23.097 --> 15:24.597
<b>to leave the mansion at all.</b>

15:24.637 --> 15:27.477
<b>I'm still afraid of mom
finding me and everything,</b>

15:27.517 --> 15:30.977
<b>but I don't want to be locked
up in here forever, so.</b>

15:31.017 --> 15:33.737
<b>This won't be some
fun little jaunt.</b>

15:33.777 --> 15:35.687
<b>It's my first walk in a while.</b>

15:35.737 --> 15:37.697
<b>I think I could
use a little fun.</b>

15:37.737 --> 15:38.817
<b>OK.</b>

15:38.867 --> 15:40.487
<b>Look forward
to working together.</b>

15:40.527 --> 15:43.537
<b>Don't start getting all
friendly with me, though.</b>

15:43.577 --> 15:46.077
<b>I have no intention
of following in Beatrice and</b>

15:46.117 --> 15:48.367
<b>Petra's footsteps, understand?</b>

15:56.967 --> 15:59.217
<b>Hey, Julius, what's up?</b>

16:01.757 --> 16:03.347
<b>I was just thinking.</b>

16:06.347 --> 16:11.187
<b>About being forgotten,
and forgetting.</b>

16:11.227 --> 16:14.267
<b>Which one is more
painful, I wonder?</b>

16:14.317 --> 16:17.187
<b>Why would you expect
me to have the answer?</b>

16:17.237 --> 16:19.397
<b>Knock it off with
the emo stuff.</b>

16:19.447 --> 16:21.777
<b>Who cares which one is
worse than the other?</b>

16:21.827 --> 16:23.447
<b>Both of them can kiss my ass.</b>

16:23.487 --> 16:26.867
<b>Stop making a competition
over how painful things are.</b>

16:26.907 --> 16:27.867
<b>Subaru.</b>

16:27.907 --> 16:29.247
<b>And quit looking like</b>

16:29.287 --> 16:30.667
<b>a little kicked puppy.</b>

16:30.707 --> 16:33.087
<b>Did you forget
or something, Julius?</b>

16:33.127 --> 16:35.297
<b>No, you can't forget, Julius.</b>

16:35.337 --> 16:38.007
<b>I've seen with my own two
eyes how strong you are.</b>

16:38.047 --> 16:40.127
<b>My shame always reminds me.</b>

16:40.177 --> 16:42.677
<b>It doesn't matter
if no one else knows.</b>

16:47.427 --> 16:51.937
<b>Just, you truly are
a remarkable man, you know?</b>

16:51.977 --> 16:55.107
<b>I'm realizing it
all over again.</b>

16:55.147 --> 16:58.277
<b>But yes, you're right.</b>

16:58.317 --> 16:59.947
<b>It's not as if I've
been left behind</b>

16:59.987 --> 17:01.947
<b>by everything and everyone.</b>

17:01.987 --> 17:03.527
<b>You couldn't be left behind.</b>

17:03.567 --> 17:04.987
<b>If anything, it's more
like you've always</b>

17:05.027 --> 17:06.617
<b>been three lengths ahead.</b>

17:06.657 --> 17:08.827
<b>Don't you think three
is a bit conservative?</b>

17:08.867 --> 17:10.747
<b>Do you want me
to kick your ass?</b>

17:10.787 --> 17:13.457
<b>Beako and I have come a hell of
a long way as a team, you know.</b>

17:13.497 --> 17:15.167
<b>[Julius chuckles]</b>

17:24.967 --> 17:25.967
<b>Hi, Ram.</b>

17:26.007 --> 17:27.177
<b>I was just preparing</b>

17:27.217 --> 17:28.307
<b>for our departure.</b>

17:28.347 --> 17:30.137
<b>I bathed her and dressed her</b>

17:30.177 --> 17:31.767
<b>in fresh clothes.</b>

17:31.807 --> 17:35.017
<b>You're getting a lewd look
on your face, pervert.</b>

17:35.057 --> 17:37.067
<b>I kept quiet because I
didn't know what to say,</b>

17:37.107 --> 17:38.727
<b>and that's what I get?</b>

17:38.777 --> 17:41.277
<b>You really might
die this time.</b>

17:41.317 --> 17:43.027
<b>Why are you doing this?</b>

17:45.317 --> 17:47.237
<b>[SUBARU] I think
I can't help but</b>

17:47.277 --> 17:49.197
<b>want to be the very
first thing she sees</b>

17:49.237 --> 17:51.247
<b>when she finally wakes up.</b>

17:51.287 --> 17:53.157
<b>Taking feelings out
of the equation,</b>

17:53.207 --> 17:56.877
<b>I know it doesn't matter who
does it, just that it happens.</b>

17:56.917 --> 18:00.507
<b>But the thing is, when
emotions come into play,</b>

18:00.547 --> 18:02.007
<b>I want to save her.</b>

18:02.047 --> 18:03.757
<b>I want to give
everything I have</b>

18:03.797 --> 18:05.927
<b>and be the one
to bring her back.</b>

18:08.767 --> 18:10.177
<b>[RAM] You're so dumb.</b>

18:19.857 --> 18:22.237
<b>Sorry it took me
so long to come see you.</b>

18:22.277 --> 18:25.737
<b>There was a bunch of other
stuff I had to take care of.</b>

18:25.777 --> 18:28.657
<b>Sorry, that's just an excuse.</b>

18:34.617 --> 18:37.877
<b>It might really mean
something this time.</b>

18:37.917 --> 18:40.837
<b>I'm going to save
you to get you back.</b>

18:43.047 --> 18:45.967
<b>I swear, that's a promise.</b>

18:48.757 --> 18:51.517
<b>[REALA] After you traveled
all this way, sorry,</b>

18:51.557 --> 18:54.427
<b>I don't have anything
special prepared for you.</b>

18:54.477 --> 18:58.477
<b>Nah, my bad
for dropping by like this.</b>

18:58.517 --> 19:01.187
<b>We really don't want to put
you through any trouble.</b>

19:01.227 --> 19:03.227
<b>Oh, it's not any
trouble at all.</b>

19:03.277 --> 19:06.147
<b>You took the time and effort
to come here and visit me.</b>

19:06.197 --> 19:08.907
<b>If anything, seeing
you puts me at ease.</b>

19:11.697 --> 19:16.407
<b>My husband, Garek, will
be home any time now.</b>

19:16.457 --> 19:18.787
<b>I have total faith in him.</b>

19:18.837 --> 19:22.497
<b>When I was empty inside and had
nothing, he came into my life</b>

19:22.547 --> 19:26.087
<b>and granted me
these past 10 years.</b>

19:26.127 --> 19:29.507
<b>He even gave me an adorable
daughter and son.</b>

19:29.547 --> 19:31.887
<b>See, he's given me
so many wonderful things,</b>

19:31.927 --> 19:33.677
<b>how could I not believe in him?</b>

19:35.057 --> 19:37.847
<b>You are so strong.</b>

19:37.887 --> 19:39.687
<b>[REALA] Yeah, of course I am.</b>

19:39.727 --> 19:43.857
<b>I mean, as a mother of two,
that's to be expected.</b>

19:43.897 --> 19:46.947
<b>Oh, right, there's something
that's been on my mind.</b>

19:46.987 --> 19:50.737
<b>And so I wanted to ask
you, Mr. Gorgeous</b>

19:50.777 --> 19:54.037
<b>Tiger, you always seem to show
so much concern for us.</b>

19:54.077 --> 19:57.077
<b>Can you tell me
why that might be?</b>

19:57.117 --> 20:00.917
<b>Uh, I just can't
take my eyes off you.</b>

20:00.957 --> 20:03.047
<b>It's hard to explain.</b>

20:03.087 --> 20:06.417
<b>And you guys are, well, kind
of losing it, aren't you?</b>

20:06.457 --> 20:08.007
<b>Oh, my, how mean.</b>

20:08.047 --> 20:11.297
<b>But unfortunately, it is true,
so I can't argue with you.</b>

20:11.347 --> 20:12.297
<b>Huh?</b>

20:12.347 --> 20:14.467
<b>Losing what, hair?</b>

20:14.517 --> 20:16.467
<b>I totally get it, cause
I lose a bunch of hair</b>

20:16.517 --> 20:17.597
<b>when it's hot, too.</b>

20:17.637 --> 20:21.397
<b>[laughing]</b>

20:24.107 --> 20:27.607
<b>Are you all right,
Mr. Gorgeous Tiger?</b>

20:27.647 --> 20:30.947
<b>I'm not sure why,
but right now,</b>

20:30.987 --> 20:32.577
<b>you look like
a young child who's</b>

20:32.617 --> 20:34.537
<b>about to burst into tears.</b>

20:34.577 --> 20:37.907
<b>[sobs]</b>

20:37.947 --> 20:42.037
<b>[somber music]</b>

20:43.787 --> 20:45.047
<b>[GARFIEL] Mom.</b>

20:46.547 --> 20:47.797
<b>Mom.</b>

20:48.917 --> 20:52.297
<b>It's just that I really want--</b>

20:52.337 --> 20:54.887
<b>I really want my mom.</b>

20:56.887 --> 20:58.307
<b>He's Garfiel.</b>

20:59.677 --> 21:01.017
<b>That's his real name.</b>

21:01.057 --> 21:02.477
<b>Huh?</b>

21:02.517 --> 21:05.227
<b>[sobbing]</b>

21:06.477 --> 21:08.027
<b>Hey, Garfiel.</b>

21:10.447 --> 21:12.487
<b>Hey, Mom.</b>

21:12.527 --> 21:14.527
<b>I miss you.</b>

21:14.577 --> 21:15.527
<b>Mom.</b>

21:15.577 --> 21:18.327
<b>[sobs]</b>

21:20.577 --> 21:22.207
<b>[REALA] There, there.</b>

21:22.247 --> 21:25.627
<b>Oh, Garf, sweetie, good boy.</b>

21:25.667 --> 21:28.707
<b>All this time, you've been
giving it everything, huh?</b>

21:28.757 --> 21:30.417
<b>[GARFIEL] I have.</b>

21:30.467 --> 21:33.087
<b>I tried so hard.</b>

21:33.137 --> 21:35.427
<b>Gave it all I had.</b>

21:35.467 --> 21:39.637
<b>But I got so many things wrong.</b>

21:39.677 --> 21:44.267
<b>And still, and still everyone--</b>

21:44.307 --> 21:45.897
<b>[REALA] It's all right.</b>

21:45.937 --> 21:48.067
<b>It'll all be OK, Garf.</b>

21:49.147 --> 21:51.437
<b>Your mother is
here with you now.</b>

21:51.487 --> 21:54.657
<b>[sobbing]</b>

21:56.367 --> 21:59.117
<b>[groans]</b>

21:59.157 --> 22:01.367
<b>Hey, Garf, you good?</b>

22:01.407 --> 22:02.537
<b>Yeah.</b>

22:02.577 --> 22:04.787
<b>Gorgeous Tiger, are you OK?</b>

22:04.827 --> 22:08.167
<b>I can't believe I just saw a
boy cry his eyes out like that.</b>

22:08.207 --> 22:10.667
<b>Sorry to go and freak
you all out like that.</b>

22:10.707 --> 22:13.417
<b>It's about time that we
head out, so you can relax.</b>

22:13.467 --> 22:16.257
<b>Please come visit
again anytime you'd like.</b>

22:16.297 --> 22:18.177
<b>When you feel like
crying, I'd be</b>

22:18.217 --> 22:20.807
<b>more than happy to help you
by lending you my shoulder</b>

22:20.847 --> 22:22.977
<b>in your mother's stead.</b>

22:23.017 --> 22:26.187
<b>And I'll do whatever I can to
make sure that doesn't happen.</b>

22:26.227 --> 22:30.067
<b>[REALA] Come on now, you two,
let's say our goodbyes, OK?</b>

22:30.107 --> 22:33.437
<b>Gorgeous Tiger, see you.</b>

22:33.487 --> 22:36.157
<b>Now, Rafiel, you too.</b>

22:37.987 --> 22:39.407
<b>Rafiel?</b>

22:39.447 --> 22:41.577
<b>Yes, that's right.</b>

22:41.617 --> 22:45.707
<b>Oh, did I never actually
properly introduce you to them?</b>

22:45.747 --> 22:48.707
<b>Better late than
never, I suppose.</b>

22:48.747 --> 22:51.297
<b>This is Fred and Rafiel.</b>

22:51.337 --> 22:54.297
<b>I came up with both
of their names myself.</b>

22:54.337 --> 22:56.887
<b>Those names were from you?</b>

22:56.927 --> 22:58.007
<b>Yes.</b>

22:58.047 --> 22:59.557
<b>I was trying to think of some</b>

22:59.597 --> 23:00.967
<b>cute names for babies,</b>

23:01.017 --> 23:03.387
<b>and those ones just came to me.</b>

23:03.427 --> 23:06.767
<b>Fred and Rafiel.</b>

23:06.807 --> 23:09.607
<b>Frederica, Garfiel.</b>

23:11.777 --> 23:14.687
<b>[laughs]</b>

23:14.737 --> 23:17.657
<b>Well, see you later,
Rafiel and Fred.</b>

23:17.697 --> 23:18.657
<b>I'll be back.</b>

23:18.697 --> 23:19.657
<b>OK.</b>

23:19.697 --> 23:21.287
<b>See you soon then.</b>

23:21.327 --> 23:24.867
<b>Hey, next time you come, you
better not be a big crybaby.</b>

23:24.907 --> 23:26.117
<b>Heh.</b>

23:29.707 --> 23:31.957
<b>Thanks, Mom.</b>

23:33.757 --> 23:36.627
<b>I'll drop by for a visit again.</b>

23:36.667 --> 23:39.007
<b>Take care of yourselves
till then.</b>
